{
  "changelog": "Initial release of lineage-skill.\n\n- Converts diverse learning materials (courses, books, video, audio, PDFs, slides, transcripts, OCR, notes) into source-grounded learning Skills.\n- Follows a structured method from source capture to learner graduation, ensuring source traceability and robust mastery validation.\n- Supports CoursePackage migration, teacher method extraction, learning paths, assessment/practice bank creation, and private learner workflows.\n- Details technical invariants, provider configuration, and step-by-step commands for compiling, merging, and migrating learning materials.\n- Maintains separation between teacher assets and learner data; enforces privacy and review/evidence protocols.",
